+| E6. Haiku 5.5 defaults to `medium` in Claude Code. | **HOLDS** | [Haiku prompting](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/prompting-claude-haiku-5-5), vendor, undated: explicit for both API and Claude Code. Vendor-only support. |
+| E7. Fable 5.1 defaults to `high` in Claude Code. | **HOLDS** | [Claude Code configuration](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/model-config), vendor, undated: `high` applies except for the enumerated models, which do not include Fable. Vendor-only support. |
