+| C2. Opus 5.5 at `max` emits within roughly 4x to 10x Astra's output tokens. | **HOLDS** | [AA Opus/Astra comparison](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/comparisons/claude-opus-5-5-vs-gpt-6-astra), independent, undated: 119K versus 27K per task, about 4.4x, both `max`. |
+| C3. Sonnet 5.5 at `max` emits within roughly 4x to 10x Astra's output tokens. | **HOLDS** | [AA Sonnet/Astra comparison](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/comparisons/claude-sonnet-5-5-vs-gpt-6-astra), independent, undated: 197K versus 27K, about 7.3x, both `max`. |
+| C4. Astra costs less per task than Opus 5.5 despite higher token prices. | **HOLDS** | [AA Opus/Astra comparison](https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/comparisons/claude-opus-5-5-vs-gpt-6-astra), independent, undated: $3.26 versus $5.98, both `max`. Benchmark-specific, not an assurance about arbitrary workloads. |
