+| P6. Haiku 5.5 costs $0.10/$0.50 up to 100K input tokens, then $0.50/$2.50. | **HOLDS** | [Haiku overview](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/haiku-5-5/overview), vendor, undated. The threshold is strictly above 100,000. |
